<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
<div class="container"><nav class="breadcrumbs"><ol><li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li><li>Miami Mortgage Guides</li></ol></nav></div><section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Miami mortgage resource hub</p><h1>Miami Mortgage Guides for Buyers, Homeowners, and Investors</h1><p>Research FHA loans, condo financing, jumbo mortgages, first-time buyer programs, down payment assistance, refinance options, DSCR loans, bank statement loans, and local Miami-Dade mortgage planning.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="start.html">Start Mortgage Review</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="mortgage-calculator-florida.html">Calculate Payment</a></div><div class="trust-row"><span class="trust-pill">Matthew Gromadzki</span><span class="trust-pill">NMLS #2560919</span><span class="trust-pill">Call (305) 988-4806</span></div></div><div class="hero-panel rate-card"><div class="rate-item"><span>Best first step</span><strong>Preapproval</strong></div><div class="rate-item"><span>Core review</span><strong>Payment + cash to close</strong></div><div class="rate-item"><span>Miami focus</span><strong>Condo + jumbo checks</strong></div><a class="btn btn-primary full" href="start.html">Send Scenario</a></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container two-col"><article class="prose"><h2>Use the guides as a Miami-Dade mortgage map</h2><p>Mortgage decisions in Miami-Dade are rarely one-dimensional. The same buyer may need to compare FHA, conventional, jumbo, condo, bank statement, DSCR, or foreign national financing depending on property type, down payment, income documentation, association dues, insurance, and timing.</p><p>Each guide links to the related loan program, your local area, the calculator, a quote, and preapproval, so you can move from question to next step easily.</p><div class="alert-box"><p><strong>Important:</strong> rates, loan limits, assistance programs, and underwriting rules change. Final borrower-facing numbers should always be confirmed before quoting or publishing.</p></div></article><aside><form class="lead-form" action="quote.html"><h2>Ask About a Mortgage Scenario</h2><p>Send your purchase price, down payment, city, credit range, income type, and property type.</p><label>Loan goal<select><option>Buying a home</option><option>Refinance</option><option>Cash-out refinance</option><option>Investment property</option></select></label><div class="form-row"><label>Name<input placeholder="Your name"></label><label>Phone<input placeholder="Phone number"></label></div><label>Email<input placeholder="Email address"></label><label>Property city<input placeholder="Miami, Doral, Brickell, etc."></label><button class="btn btn-primary full" type="submit">Request Review</button><p class="form-note">No guaranteed rates or approvals. Final options depend on underwriting.</p></form></aside></div></section><section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Supporting cluster</p><h2>FHA &amp; low down payment</h2><p>Focused resources to help you plan your Miami mortgage with confidence.</p></div><div class="card-grid"><a class="feature-card" href="fha-loan-limits-miami-dade-county.html"><h3>FHA Loan Limits in Miami-Dade County</h3><p>Review Miami-Dade FHA loan limit planning for 2026, including one-unit and multi-unit context, FHA vs conventional comparisons, and preapproval next steps.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="fha-loan-requirements-miami.html"><h3>FHA Loan Requirements in Miami</h3><p>Learn FHA loan requirements for Miami buyers, including credit, down payment, income, property condition, condo review, and closing cost planning.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="fha-vs-conventional-loan-miami.html"><h3>FHA vs Conventional Loan in Miami</h3><p>Compare FHA and conventional loans for Miami buyers, including down payment, mortgage insurance, condo eligibility, credit flexibility, and cash to close.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="fha-condo-loans-miami.html"><h3>FHA Condo Loans in Miami</h3><p>Understand FHA condo financing in Miami, including building eligibility, condo project review, insurance, HOA dues, and alternatives if FHA does not fit.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="fha-down-payment-miami.html"><h3>FHA Down Payment in Miami</h3><p>Plan an FHA down payment in Miami, including gift funds, seller credits, reserves, closing costs, and realistic cash-to-close estimates.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="fha-closing-costs-miami.html"><h3>FHA Closing Costs in Miami</h3><p>Estimate FHA closing costs in Miami, including prepaid taxes, insurance, mortgage insurance, seller credits, lender fees, and title costs.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a></div></div></section><section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Supporting cluster</p><h2>First-time buyers &amp; assistance</h2><p>Focused resources to help you plan your Miami mortgage with confidence.</p></div><div class="card-grid"><a class="feature-card" href="first-time-home-buyer-miami.html"><h3>First-Time Home Buyer in Miami</h3><p>A Miami first-time home buyer guide covering preapproval, down payment, closing costs, FHA vs conventional, assistance programs, and offer planning.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="first-time-home-buyer-programs-miami.html"><h3>First-Time Home Buyer Programs in Miami</h3><p>Review first-time home buyer programs in Miami, including state/local assistance, lender programs, eligibility, income limits, and documentation.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="down-payment-assistance-miami.html"><h3>Down Payment Assistance in Miami</h3><p>Learn how down payment assistance in Miami can affect purchase price, cash to close, loan approval, program eligibility, and homebuyer education requirements.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="miami-dade-homebuyer-assistance-program.html"><h3>Miami-Dade Homebuyer Assistance Program</h3><p>Review Miami-Dade homebuyer assistance basics, including eligibility planning, income limits, award amounts, homebuyer education, and mortgage approval.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="how-much-house-can-i-afford-miami.html"><h3>How Much House Can I Afford in Miami?</h3><p>Estimate how much house you can afford in Miami using payment, income, debt, taxes, insurance, HOA dues, and cash-to-close planning.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="closing-costs-miami-home-buyer.html"><h3>Closing Costs for Miami Home Buyers</h3><p>Understand closing costs for Miami home buyers, including lender fees, title costs, taxes, insurance, escrows, HOA/condo items, and seller credits.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="credit-score-to-buy-a-house-miami.html"><h3>Credit Score to Buy a House in Miami</h3><p>Learn how credit score affects Miami mortgage options, down payment, rate, mortgage insurance, FHA vs conventional, and preapproval strategy.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="preapproval-letter-miami.html"><h3>Mortgage Preapproval Letter in Miami</h3><p>Learn what a Miami mortgage preapproval letter should include, what sellers look for, and how to reduce approval risk before making an offer.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a></div></div></section><section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Supporting cluster</p><h2>Miami condo financing</h2><p>Focused resources to help you plan your Miami mortgage with confidence.</p></div><div class="card-grid"><a class="feature-card" href="condo-financing-miami.html"><h3>Condo Financing in Miami</h3><p>A Miami condo financing guide covering warrantable and non-warrantable condos, condo questionnaires, insurance, reserves, litigation, HOA dues, and loan options.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="warrantable-vs-non-warrantable-condo-miami.html"><h3>Warrantable vs Non-Warrantable Condo in Miami</h3><p>Compare warrantable and non-warrantable condo financing in Miami, including project review, down payment, rate, reserves, and lender options.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="condo-questionnaire-mortgage-miami.html"><h3>Condo Questionnaire for a Miami Mortgage</h3><p>Learn why the condo questionnaire matters for a Miami mortgage and what lenders review before approving a condo loan.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="miami-condo-reserve-requirements.html"><h3>Miami Condo Reserve Requirements and Mortgage Approval</h3><p>Understand how Miami condo reserves, budgets, assessments, insurance, and building finances can affect mortgage approval.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="financing-a-condo-with-litigation-miami.html"><h3>Financing a Condo with Litigation in Miami</h3><p>Learn how building litigation can affect Miami condo mortgage approval and what alternatives may exist for buyers and refinancers.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="condo-financing-brickell.html"><h3>Condo Financing in Brickell</h3><p>Review Brickell condo financing issues including HOA dues, insurance, reserves, condo questionnaires, jumbo loans, investors, and foreign buyers.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="condo-financing-miami-beach.html"><h3>Condo Financing in Miami Beach</h3><p>Review Miami Beach condo financing issues including insurance, reserves, assessments, short-term rental rules, jumbo loans, and foreign national buyers.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a></div></div></section><section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Supporting cluster</p><h2>Jumbo &amp; luxury mortgages</h2><p>Focused resources to help you plan your Miami mortgage with confidence.</p></div><div class="card-grid"><a class="feature-card" href="jumbo-loan-requirements-miami.html"><h3>Jumbo Loan Requirements in Miami</h3><p>Learn jumbo loan requirements in Miami, including reserves, credit, down payment, income, assets, condo review, and luxury property financing.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="luxury-home-mortgage-miami.html"><h3>Luxury Home Mortgage in Miami</h3><p>Plan luxury home financing in Miami, including jumbo loans, reserves, liquidity, asset documentation, condo review, and high-net-worth borrower scenarios.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="asset-depletion-mortgage-miami.html"><h3>Asset Depletion Mortgage in Miami</h3><p>Learn how asset depletion mortgage options may help Miami borrowers with strong assets but nontraditional income documentation.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="jumbo-vs-conventional-loan-miami.html"><h3>Jumbo vs Conventional Loan in Miami</h3><p>Compare jumbo and conventional loans in Miami, including loan limits, reserves, down payment, property review, pricing, and documentation.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a></div></div></section><section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Supporting cluster</p><h2>Self-employed &amp; investor loans</h2><p>Focused resources to help you plan your Miami mortgage with confidence.</p></div><div class="card-grid"><a class="feature-card" href="self-employed-mortgage-miami.html"><h3>Self-Employed Mortgage in Miami</h3><p>Mortgage guide for self-employed Miami buyers, including tax returns, bank statements, profit and loss, 1099 income, reserves, and loan options.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="bank-statement-loan-requirements-miami.html"><h3>Bank Statement Loan Requirements in Miami</h3><p>Learn bank statement loan requirements for Miami self-employed borrowers, including deposits, expense factors, reserves, credit, and property type.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="no-tax-return-mortgage-miami.html"><h3>No Tax Return Mortgage in Miami</h3><p>Learn how no-tax-return mortgage options may work in Miami using bank statements, DSCR, asset-based, or other non-QM documentation paths.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="dscr-loan-requirements-miami.html"><h3>DSCR Loan Requirements in Miami</h3><p>Learn DSCR loan requirements for Miami investment properties, including rental income, appraisal rent schedule, reserves, entity ownership, and cash flow.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="rental-property-loans-miami.html"><h3>Rental Property Loans in Miami</h3><p>Compare rental property loan options in Miami, including conventional investment loans, DSCR loans, bank statement loans, and LLC ownership.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="airbnb-loans-miami.html"><h3>Airbnb Loans in Miami</h3><p>Learn mortgage planning for Airbnb and short-term rental properties in Miami, including DSCR, rental rules, HOA restrictions, insurance, and cash flow.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="foreign-national-investor-loans-miami.html"><h3>Foreign National Investor Loans in Miami</h3><p>Mortgage guide for foreign national investors in Miami, including down payment, documentation, reserves, condo review, and rental property financing.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="llc-mortgage-loans-miami.html"><h3>LLC Mortgage Loans in Miami</h3><p>Learn how LLC mortgage loans may work for Miami investors, including entity documents, guarantors, DSCR loans, reserves, and title planning.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a></div></div></section><section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Supporting cluster</p><h2>Refinance &amp; comparison guides</h2><p>Focused resources to help you plan your Miami mortgage with confidence.</p></div><div class="card-grid"><a class="feature-card" href="heloc-vs-cash-out-refinance-miami.html"><h3>HELOC vs Cash-Out Refinance in Miami</h3><p>Compare HELOC and cash-out refinance options in Miami, including payment, closing costs, equity, rates, lien position, and debt-consolidation goals.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="debt-consolidation-refinance-miami.html"><h3>Debt Consolidation Refinance in Miami</h3><p>Learn how a Miami debt consolidation refinance can affect payment, equity, loan amount, closing costs, credit cards, and long-term interest cost.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="refinance-condo-miami.html"><h3>Refinance a Condo in Miami</h3><p>Learn how to refinance a Miami condo, including equity, appraisal, condo questionnaire, insurance, reserves, litigation, and cash-out considerations.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="mortgage-broker-vs-bank-miami.html"><h3>Mortgage Broker vs Bank in Miami</h3><p>Compare working with a mortgage broker vs a bank in Miami, including loan options, pricing, underwriting, condo review, speed, and borrower fit.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="how-to-choose-a-mortgage-broker-miami.html"><h3>How to Choose a Mortgage Broker in Miami</h3><p>Use this Miami mortgage broker checklist to compare experience, loan options, condo knowledge, communication, quote transparency, and preapproval strength.</p><span>Read guide →</span></a></div></div></section>
